82</fpage><lpage>787</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-64349095406</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Singhania</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Paul</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Maitra</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Banerjee</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hashmi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Kikuchi-fujimoto disease from eastern India</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Global Infectious Diseases</italic></source><year>2010</year><volume>2</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>305</fpage><lpage>306</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20927293</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Khanna</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Shrivastava</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Malur</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kangle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Necrotizing lymphadenitis in systemic lupus erythematosus: is it kikuchi-fujimoto disease?</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Clinical Rheumatology</italic></source><year>2010</year><volume>16</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-77951040266</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20375821</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Londhey</surname><given-names>VA</given-names></name><name><surname>Buche</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Kini</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Rajadhyaksha</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Kikuchi fujimoto disease and systemic lupus erythematosus&#x02014;a rare association</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Association of Physicians of India</italic></source><year>2010</year><volume>58</volume><issue>10</issue><fpage>642</fpage><lpage>643</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-78049297133</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21510120</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abraham</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lazareth</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonardel</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Kikuchi disease and lupus: case report, literature review and FDG PET/CT interest</article-title><source><italic>Journal des Maladies Vasculaires</italic></source><year>2011</year><volume>36</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>274</fpage><lpage>279</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21757306</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Khanna</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Shrivastava</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Malur</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kangle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Necrotizing lymphadenitis in systemic lupus erythematosus: is it kikuchi-fujimoto disease?</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Clinical Rheumatology</italic></source><year>2010</year><volume>16</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-77951040266</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20375821</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-cita